\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0   The followers of the Saviour,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 On earth are just like strangers;
\par Through toil and death they serve the Lord
\par And have a rest in heaven.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par They've finish all the race.
\par Jesus thus welcome them;
\par And they shall go down in this earth
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Just like a grain is planted.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  You've also finished your race well
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 And now we bid you fare-well
\par Your spirit have got all the peace
\par And you are free from all things
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj You have come to the Lord
\par And you are pleased with Him \tab 
\par And your loved ones have thus prepared
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj   And thus laid you in His comfort.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  We are so glad in the future
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 We shall meet in the Heaven
\par And our glory shall be revealed
\par And we shall be one nation
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus is the Great King
\par And we shall be His own
\par And with the likeness of Jesus
\par We shall inherit the new Land.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

